ature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>rap-007 Search Condition by patient returns a searchset of Condition</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-007 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Condition.search-type, Condition.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-008 Search AllergyIntolerance by patient returns a searchset of AllergyIntolerance</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-008 (input bindings and expected data). Covers AllergyIntolerance.search-type, AllergyIntolerance.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-009 Search Observation by patient returns a searchset of Observation</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-009 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Observation.search-type, Observation.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-010 Search DiagnosticReport by patient returns a searchset of DiagnosticReport</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-010 (input bindings and expected data). Covers DiagnosticReport.search-type, DiagnosticReport.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-011 Search ImagingStudy by patient returns a searchset of ImagingStudy</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-011 (input bindings and expected data). Covers ImagingStudy.search-type, ImagingStudy.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-012 Search MedicationRequest by patient returns a searchset of MedicationRequest</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-012 (input bindings and expected data). Covers MedicationRequest.search-type, MedicationRequest.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-013 Search MedicationDispense by patient returns a searchset of MedicationDispense</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-013 (input bindings and expected data). Covers MedicationDispense.search-type, MedicationDispense.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-014 Search Immunization by patient returns a searchset of Immunization</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-014 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Immunization.search-type, Immunization.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-015 Search MedicationStatement by patient returns a searchset of MedicationStatement</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-015 (input bindings and expected data). Covers MedicationStatement.search-type, MedicationStatement.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-016 Search Encounter by patient returns a searchset of Encounter</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-016 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Encounter.search-type, Encounter.search.patient.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>5 Suite: Read by id</b></p><p>Rule: Read by id — the scenarios grouped under it in the feature file.</p><p><b>Inputs</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>File</b></td></tr><tr><td>gherkin-script</td><td>eu-api-resource-access-provider.feature</td></tr></table><p><b>Tests</b></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Name</b></td><td><b>Description</b></td><td><b>Operation</b></td></tr><tr><td>rap-017 A found resource can be read back by its id</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-017 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Observation.read, Condition.read.</td><td>gherkin/Scenario</td></tr><tr><td>rap-018 An unknown id gives 404 and an OperationOutcome</td><td>Fixture contract: fixtures/provider-v1/manifest.json, cases.rap-018 (input bindings and expected data). Covers Patient